ROCK TO STARDOM 2001
BATTLE OF THE BANDS
We will be performing at
KELLY'S BLEACHERS II
(IN WIND LAKE, WI)
SATURDAY, MAY 19
The first round is an audience vote
for the winner of the night, so we need=20
every body we can get to attend to help us win!
Please support us an lets show these kids
HOW TO ROCK!


